  "display_title": "My Office Rebound Marriage",
  "description": "Once the poster couple for office romance, Dawon and Taehyeon seemed unstoppable on their march to the altar. But when Taehyeon cheats on his fiancé with another coworker at K&C, Yujeong, their fairytale begins to unravel. Just when Dawon thinks all is lost, hope emerges from the most unexpected place, the office (again), and with the most unexpected person--her boss, Junhu, known as K&C’s most eligible bachelor and the quintessential dreamboat! Could this twist of fate turn Dawon’s heartbreak into a fresh start? \n\n(Source: WEBTOONS)",
